{"abstract":[{"text":"Distribute a pass to your users or update an existing pass.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/technologies","doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"data","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/distributing-and-updating-a-pass"},"kind":"article","legalNotices":{"copyright":"Copyright &copy; 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved.","privacyPolicy":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/privacy\/privacy-policy","termsOfUse":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/legal\/internet-services\/terms\/site.html"},"metadata":{"availableLanguages":["de-DE","en-US","es-419","fr-FR","it-IT","ja-JP","ko-KR","pt-BR","zh-CN"],"modules":[{"name":"Wallet Passes"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Distributing and updating a pass"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"There are four ways you can distribute a pass:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Automatically add a pass during an in-app action.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add a pass from an app or App Clip.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Provide a download on a web page for one pass or a bundle containing multiple passes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Send a pass as an attachment in an email.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can add a pass automatically during an in-app action. When someone completes an action in your app that produces a pass, such as checking into a flight, you can add the pass to Wallet automatically without an additional confirmation prompt. Request the ","type":"text"},{"code":"backgroundAddPasses","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" capability once with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/PassKit\/PKPassLibrary\/requestAuthorization(for:completion:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". This request shows a one-time permission prompt; if you call it after the person has responded, it doesn’t prompt again, but instead returns the current status. People can manage this permission from Settings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"After the initial request, check ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/PassKit\/PKPassLibrary\/requestAuthorization(for:completion:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to silently determine whether someone authorized your app to add passes in the background, without showing a prompt. If the status is ","type":"text"},{"code":"authorized","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", call ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/PassKit\/PKPassLibrary\/addPasses(_:withCompletionHandler:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" with an array of one or more passes to add them to Wallet in a single call. Wallet adds the passes in the background and notifies the person with a system notification instead of an on-device confirmation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you don’t request ","type":"text"},{"code":"backgroundAddPasses","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the ","type":"text"},{"code":"addPasses","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method shows a prompt on the device before adding each pass to Wallet.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Automatically adding passes during an in-app action requires your app to be installed and running on the device.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In your app or App Clip, add a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/PassKit\/PKAddPassButton","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to show that a pass is available. When the user taps the button, show a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/PassKit\/PKAddPassesViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for the pass.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On your website, show an Add to Apple Wallet button. Download the pass when the user clicks the button. For more information on displaying the button, see the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/wallet\/add-to-apple-wallet-guidelines","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Update a pass by distributing a new version of the pass with the same pass identifier and serial number. For more information on the pass identifier and serial number, see the ","type":"text"},{"code":"passTypeIdentifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"serialNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" keys of the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/Pass","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can optionally provide a web service to update the contents of a user’s pass, such as changing the time for an event. For more information about implementing a pass update web service, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/adding-a-web-service-to-update-passes","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Create-a-bundle-of-passes","level":3,"text":"Create a bundle of passes","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Provide a bundle of passes to enable your user to download multiple passes at once. To create the pass bundle:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create a ","type":"text"},{"code":".zip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file containing the ","type":"text"},{"code":".pkpass","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" files for the passes that are part of the bundle.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Change the extension of the ","type":"text"},{"code":".zip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file to ","type":"text"},{"code":".pkpasses","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can distribute a bundle of passes the same way you distribute a single pass. The MIME type for a bundle of passes is “","type":"text"},{"code":"application\/vnd.apple.pkpasses\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can have up to 10 passes or 150 MB for a bundle of passes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/creating-a-pass-with-pass-designer","doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/creating-a-poster-generic-pass","doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/creating-the-source-for-a-pass","doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/building-a-pass","doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/defining-the-metadata-of-your-wallet-pass","doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/Pass","doc:\/\/com.apple.walletpasses\/documentation\/WalletPasses\/PassFields"],"title":"Essentials"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/walletpasses\/distributing-and-